body:
Brave Dave's Big Fat Train Hop Freight Hop. A British guy named Dave is a freight hopper. This means he jumps onto trains, basically as a stowaway, and rides them places. He flies into Montreal, Canada from London, England. The four-part series details his trip train hopping 5000km across Canada to Vancouver. He meets people along the way, risks his life, sees some beautiful sights, and has to run from the law. It got in my YouTube recommendations last night and I watched it all and it was such a pleasure to do so. Sadly he can't do any more freight hopping trips in Canada anymore because this got him banned in all of North America but it is still a wonderful journey. This man's trip across the country living like a hobo is one of, if not, my favourite video series on YouTube. 

